; HPMMO interface theme.
;
; Base palette, control styles and type scale for existing screens. UITheme
; additionally installs opt-in ArcaneSkin roles with textured chrome; ordinary
; controls retain these stable StyleBoxFlat layouts and content margins.
;
; The palette lives in the `Palette` type rather than in a JSON beside the art,
; so the colours and the boxes that use them cannot drift apart. `UITheme.c()`
; reads it; `UITheme.get_theme()` loads this file and registers the type
; variations below (`Card`, `WindowFrame`, `HpBar`, `ManaBar`, `ExpBar`,
; `BossBar`, `SlotButton`, `TitleLabel`) against their base types.
;
; Type scale and the screen grid stay in `scripts/ui/ui_theme.gd`, because they
; are read by layout code rather than by the theme system.

[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=36 format=3]

